OL,5,     GWith his band Sha Na Na, Robert
OL,6,     GLeonard sparked a '50s revival
OL,7,     Gsinging doo-wop to hippies. He
OL,8,     Geven sang at Woodstock - before
OL,9,     Gquitting to become a forensic
OL,10,     Glinguist.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn April 1975, the train began a
OL,13,     Gtour of the US to celebrate 200
OL,14,     Gyears of American independence.
OL,15,     GOn board were more than 500
OL,16,     Gmuseum pieces documenting
OL,17,     GAmerica's history.
